{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10011_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c1329ce8cfaa8a60ed1cba29bd3bd4095c405f67f380a296dc3bea3f812c4402",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07f0f0eb6e568d69c5903b1bfbaf1cb1a7dd03b53dcbebd3647c22091b18df4c",
      "text": "再次祝贺，摇滚音乐节辛苦了！\n取得了巨大的成功呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2904970a3af83c5f3ad718853600064ae5937d8da2d8a37422b1d0e8a50f120f",
      "text": "噢！听说成了大热门的话题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c76d1a19cf12c19286efc741c948f10fec9ae6bdb06b09b2a2ebbf44203a2ca",
      "text": "冬马先生认识的那位朋友，听说也能够\n再次在Livehouse办演出了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d5e598209bdd9ec489fa9a1a1ad6ce95b0f055c6deb39f2f01a4296ec4a6d9a",
      "text": "这样啊……\n嘿嘿，能帮上忙太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8afab67278353f330ae444dced17d61b986831db545ceeae85b42a8daf343e7",
      "text": "咳咳……呜——喉咙好痛哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:170209a876189b487ebce2d4321b00da36ed04454dca2219cf51d9fb9eee60ad",
      "text": "我的手臂也有点痛呢……\n太拼命了，变成肌肉酸痛了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c183367fafd63f3cec5568babbb25dbadfd347053e5be44b27dd5ab56c045aa0",
      "text": "搞什么啊你们两个。\n明明是让人高兴的汇报，怎么在这抱怨啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:216820318455322b8c41625b04b0f89ead5db3cb73813cdff4c3d8aa6d64ab4d",
      "text": "呵呵，不是那样的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53777552b4efd24096c002208a6ab1ea4bb899b0fc1dd06972f17616064abcfa",
      "text": "我们只是因为当时太尽兴了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1a48dbd826dc6394b85b0299b233c28a9637e93721ad56e4fc168bfb51e871f",
      "text": "想说跟着冬马一路走来真是太好了而已哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
